# AI News Bot — Admin / Mini App (nginx)

Ochiq sayt: `/` · Admin panel: `/admin`
Static UI: `public/` · API va audio: Node (`src/server.ts`) port `8787`

## Telegram Mini App

1. HTTPS orqali oching (Telegram Mini App uchun majburiy).
2. BotFather → Bot Settings → Menu Button → URL: `https://your-domain/`
3. `.env` ga qo‘ying: `WEBAPP_URL=https://your-domain/`
4. `/start` da **Mini App — o‘qish** tugmasi chiqadi.

## nginx misol

```nginx
server {
    listen 80;
    server_name news-admin.example.com;

    root /var/www/news-bot/public;
    index index.html;

    # Admin panel alohida sahifa
    location = /admin {
        try_files /admin.html =404;
        add_header Cache-Control "no-cache, must-revalidate";
    }

    # Rasm/logo — yo‘q bo‘lsa 404, index.html emas
    location /images/ {
        try_files $uri =404;
    }

    # Telegram WebView statik fayllarni qattiq keshlaydi — eski JS qolib
    # ketsa sayt yangilanmaydi. Har safar qayta tekshirsin:
    location / {
        try_files $uri $uri/ /index.html;
        add_header Cache-Control "no-cache, must-revalidate";
    }

    # Audio fayllar Node orqali beriladi (data/audio/ ichida)
    location /audio/ {
        proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:8787;
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
    }

    location /api/ {
        proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:8787;
        proxy_http_version 1.1;
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
        proxy_read_timeout 300s;

        # initData sarlavhasi uzun bo‘ladi (~1 KB)
        proxy_buffer_size 16k;
        proxy_buffers 4 16k;
    }
}
```

> `add_header` ni qo‘shgach: `sudo nginx -t && sudo systemctl reload nginx`

## Serverda

```bash
cd /var/www/news-bot
npm ci
npm run admin
```
